      "min_role": "viewer",
      "display_token": true,
      "note": "The fourth place certificates hide: a file on a disk, behind two firewalls, that no scan, no transparency log, and no cloud API will ever mention. Reading is open to any authenticated user \u2014 it carries paths and permissions, never key material.",
