      "min_role": "viewer",
      "display_token": true,
      "note": "Where the fleet has put its certificates. `?attention=true` returns the two rows nothing else in this system can produce: a destination that failed on the far side of every firewall, and a host configured to install a certificate that does not exist.",
      "source_line": 358
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/agent/certificates",
      "section": "The agent API",
      "handler": "agentHandler.RequestCertificate",
      "auth": "agent-signature",
      "min_role": null,
      "display_token": false,
      "note": "The point of the agent: the host generated the key, and sends only a request. CertPilot signs what an operator granted this host and never holds a private key it could lose or be compelled to produce.",
      "source_line": 135
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/agent/deployments/claim",
